[IQ Generator Preset]
# Lesson 9: IQ imbalance on 64-QAM.
# A 1.5 dB gain mismatch and 5 degrees of quadrature skew squeeze and shear the grid. Dense constellations tolerate this far less than QPSK. Check the Spectrum tab for the mirror image the imbalance creates, and reset both values to 0 for the ideal grid. Use the Constellation tab with the matched-filter view.
